    "text": "FOX 21 Online\nwebsite\nDuluth\nDuluth Police Department Hosts Annual Kids, Cops and Cars Event\nBy Paige Hansen,\n5 hours agoDULUTH, Minn. — Kids got to learn about the life of first responders today at Bayfront Festival Park. The Duluth Police Department hosted its annual Kids, Cops and Cars event to showcase the vehicles on the force. Kids got to explore squad cars and see other law enforcement equipment,...\n2",
